      "name": "Jail / Sandbox Escape",
      "x_ctft_shortname": "jal",
      "x_ctft_domain": "JAL",
      "description": "Challenges where the author constructs a restricted execution environment — a language-level sandbox, a limited shell, or an OS/kernel isolation boundary — to prevent direct flag access. Solvers must find a path out of the confinement. (HTB: Misc (Jail))",
