      "name": "CTFTCTE-JAL-003 - Break out of the container to the host",
      "description": "Enumerate container capabilities with amicontained; if --privileged, mount the host filesystem or load a kernel module. If the Docker socket is mounted, use it to spin up a new container with a host-root bind-mount. If a writable host path is mounted, write an SUID binary or modify a cron job.",
